/* A vanilla locked/jammed door is a second event row on the doorway's POI
 * whose sysState is SysState_EventCallback and whose eventParam selects the
 * shared MapEvent_DoorJammed / MapEvent_DoorLocked. Those sit at
 * mapEventFuncs[0] and [1] -- but only in SOME maps, so identifying (and
 * unlocking) them needs this per-map mask.
 *   bit 0 = mapEventFuncs[0] is MapEvent_DoorJammed
 *   bit 1 = mapEventFuncs[1] is MapEvent_DoorLocked */
